999,\"contrast\":1.1000000000000001,\"saturation\":1.05,\"sepia\":0.10000000000000001,\"vignette\":0.29999999999999999},\"speed\":0.88900000000000001,\"start_ms\":0},{\"asset_id\":\"DF9D9CE9-104A-462B-A7C0-F12C7D310760\",\"end_ms\":6000,\"fade_out_ms\":900,\"look\":{\"brightness\":0.029999999999999999,\"contrast\":0.97999999999999998,\"saturation\":1.1000000000000001,\"sepia\":0,\"vignette\":0.10000000000000001},\"speed\":0.88900000000000001,\"start_ms\":0,\"transition\":\"blurFade\",\"transition_ms\":1000}],\"music\":{\"name\":\"Calm Ambient\",\"volume\":0.5},\"overlays\":[{\"amount\":0.29999999999999999,\"duration_ms\":5500,\"fade_in_ms\":1000,\"fade_out_ms\":1200,\"kind\":\"fireflies\",\"start_ms\":18500}],\"replace\":true,\"titles\":[{\"duration_ms\":3400,\"fade_in_ms\":800,\"fade_out_ms\":800,\"preset\":\"center\",\"start_ms\":600,\"text\":\"Four Quiet Places\"}]}","frame":"f001.png"},{"tool":"watch_timeline","ms":24996,"clips":7,"error":false,"text":"{\"frames\":10}","kind":"tool"},{"text":"The film is built at 25.0 s and the timeline review looks right. I checked it with ten frames across the whole film and haven't played it back.\n\n- **Structure:** a slow burn of four scenes in the order sunset, ocean, city, forest, each about 6.7 s. I slowed each to about 0.89× so the film reaches 25 s and stays calm. I made a few other choices (listed below).\n- **Title:** \"Four Quiet Places\" fades in over the sunset and out by about 4 s.\n- **Looks:** each scene has its own grade:\n  - sunset is warm and golden\n  - ocean is cool and slightly muted\n  - city is a deep, contrasty purple\n  - forest is fresh and bright\n- **Joins:** a 1 s crossfade from sunset to ocean, a hard cut from ocean to city, and a 1 s blur-fade from city to forest. The editor refuses plans where most cuts have transitions, so I kept the ocean-to-city cut hard.\n- **Overlay:** a sparse fireflies overlay over the forest, fading in and out, from 18.5 s to the end.\n- **Music:** the built-in \"Calm Ambient\" bed at 0.5 volume. The clips have no sound of their own.\n\nWant it as \"Quiet and wide\" instead, with longer holds, a matte look and a single closing line?","kind":"text"}]